from blog_data_mk import mk
P3 = []

P3.append(mk(
'real-estate-lead-follow-up-automation-guide',
'Real Estate Lead Follow-up Automation: Property Dealer Ke Liye Guide',
'Real Estate Lead Follow-up Automation: Dealer Ke Liye Guide',
'Property dealer aur builder ke liye lead follow-up automation guide: lead kahan se aati hai, kab kya bhejein, kya automate karein aur kya kabhi nahi.',
'Real Estate',
'real estate lead follow up automation',
'Chhota ghar ka model, chaabi, chat bubbles wala phone aur teen jude gol jinme aakhri par hara nishaan',
'Property lead ka follow-up automate karne ka seedha tareeka: lead ko ek jagah jama kijiye, 5 minute me pehla reply dijiye, phir 1, 3, 7, 15 aur 30 din par alag alag kaam ka message bhejiye. Site visit, price negotiation aur loan ki baat insaan hi karein.',
"""<p>Property ka business lamba chalta hai. Ek lead ko deal banne me hafte, kabhi mahine lag jaate hain. Is beech me dealer ke paas 30-40 aur lead hoti hain, aur har ek ko yaad rakhna insaan ke bas ki baat nahi. Isliye zyada tar dealers ki lead "bhool jane" ki wajah se mar jaati hain, "na" ki wajah se nahi. Is guide me seedha bataya hai ki follow-up ko system se kaise sambhaalein aur kahan nahi.</p>
<h2>Lead kahan se aati hai aur kahan kho jaati hai</h2>
<p>Property ki lead aam taur par in jagahon se aati hai:</p>
<ul>
<li>99acres, Housing, MagicBricks jaise portals</li>
<li>Facebook aur Instagram ke ads</li>
<li>Board, banner aur site par lagi hoardings</li>
<li>Rishtedar aur purane customer ka reference</li>
<li>Walk-in aur call</li>
</ul>
<p>Problem ye hai ki ye sab alag alag jagah par aati hain: kuch call log me, kuch WhatsApp me, kuch portal ke dashboard me. Aur jab tak sab ek jagah nahi aati, follow-up bikhra rehta hai. Pehla kaam hai: <b>ek hi list me sab lead jama karna</b>. Ye ek sheet bhi ho sakti hai.</p>
<h2>Lead ki list me kya likhna hai</h2>
<ol>
<li>Naam aur number</li>
<li>Kahan se aayi (portal, ad, reference)</li>
<li>Kya chahiye: plot, flat, kitna budget, kaun si location</li>
<li>Pehla contact kab hua</li>
<li>Abhi kis stage me hai: nayi, baat hui, site visit hua, negotiation, band</li>
<li>Agla follow-up kab</li>
</ol>
<p>Ye 6 cheezein agar har lead ke saath likhi jaaye, to koi lead bhoolti nahi.</p>
<h2>Follow-up ka seedha schedule</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Samay</th><th>Kya bhejein</th><th>Maksad</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>5 minute ke andar</td><td>Greeting + 2-3 sawal (budget, location, kab tak)</td><td>Lead ko garm rakhna</td></tr>
<tr><td>1 din baad</td><td>Matching property ki 2-3 photo aur rate</td><td>Kaam ki jaankari dena</td></tr>
<tr><td>3 din baad</td><td>Site visit ka invite</td><td>Milne ki wajah banana</td></tr>
<tr><td>7 din baad</td><td>Koi nayi cheez: naya plot ya naya flat</td><td>Dobara dhyan khichna</td></tr>
<tr><td>15 din baad</td><td>Market ya project ki ek chhoti khabar</td><td>Rishta banaye rakhna</td></tr>
<tr><td>30 din baad</td><td>Seedha sawal: "Abhi bhi dekh rahe hain?"</td><td>Lead ko band ya wapas jodna</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2>Kya automate hota hai aur kya nahi</h2>
<h3>System ko dijiye</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pehla turant reply aur sawal poochhna.</li>
<li>Lead ko list me sahi stage me daalna.</li>
<li>Photo aur rate wale message bhejna.</li>
<li>Site visit ka reminder aur visit ke baad ka message.</li>
<li>30 din tak chup lead ko wapas jagana.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Insaan ko rakhiye</h3>
<ul>
<li>Site visit par saath chalna aur property dikhana.</li>
<li>Rate par baat aur negotiation.</li>
<li>Loan, registry aur legal documents ki salah.</li>
<li>Jis lead ne naraazgi dikhayi use sambhalna.</li>
</ul>
<p>Ek seedhi baat: property bahut bada faisla hai. Koi bhi insaan lakhon ka faisla ek chatbot ke bharose nahi leta. System ka kaam lead ko aap tak pahunchana aur aapko yaad dilana hai, aapki jagah lena nahi.</p>
<h2>Site visit ke baad ka follow-up sabse zaroori hai</h2>
<p>Site visit ke baad ke 48 ghante property me sabse kaam ke hote hain. Customer ne zameen ya flat dekha hai, ghar jaakar parivaar se baat kar raha hai, aur doosre dealer se bhi mil raha hai. Jo dealer us samay chup rehta hai, wo peeche chhoot jata hai. Iske liye alag se 6 message templates likhe hain: <a href="/blog/site-visit-follow-up-property-dealer-templates/">site visit ke baad follow-up</a>.</p>
<h2>Ye galtiyan dealers aksar karte hain</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Sab lead ko ek hi message.</b> Plot dekhne wale ko flat ke message bhejna.</li>
<li><b>Roz message bhejna.</b> Customer pareshan hota hai aur block kar deta hai.</li>
<li><b>Galat wade.</b> "Rate badhne wala hai" tabhi likhiye jab sach me aisa ho.</li>
<li><b>Legal baat chhupana.</b> Registry, RERA ya documents ke sawal par seedha aur saaf jawab dijiye. Jahan aap sure nahi hain, wahan kehiye ki aap check karke batayenge.</li>
<li><b>Lead ka data bechna ya share karna.</b> Customer ka number sirf aapke kaam ke liye hai.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Kitna kaam, kitna kharcha</h2>
<p>Pehle ek sheet aur WhatsApp Business app se shuru karna bilkul theek hai. Jab lead roz 10-15 se upar jane lagein ya kai log ek hi lead sambhalne lagein, tab system banta hai. autenflo ka setup ₹14,999 se aur monthly ₹5,999 se shuru hota hai. Ek property deal ki value itni badi hoti hai ki ek bachi hui lead bhi system ke kharche se zyada ho sakti hai, par ye sab aapki lead aur aapke kaam par nirbhar karta hai, aur hum koi percentage ka wada nahi karte.</p>
<h2>Shuru kaise karein: 3 din me</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Din 1:</b> Pichhle 30 din ki sabhi leads ek sheet me daaliye.</li>
<li><b>Din 2:</b> Har lead ko stage dijiye aur agla follow-up date likhiye.</li>
<li><b>Din 3:</b> Upar ki table ke hisaab se 5 messages likhiye aur bhejna shuru kijiye.</li>
</ol>
<p>Property ke liye alag se detail <a href="/ai-automation-for-real-estate/">real estate ke liye AI automation</a> page par hai. Aur agar aapko pata nahi ki kahan se shuru karein, to <a href="/blog/follow-up-kab-karein-bina-pareshan-kiye/">follow-up kab karein</a> padhiye.</p>
<h2>Meri raay</h2>
<p>Property me jeet usi ki hoti hai jo lead ko bhoolta nahi. Aur bhoolne ka ilaaj bahut simple hai: ek list, ek schedule, aur ek aadat. Pehle ye teen cheezein haath se banaiye. Phir jab bojh lage, system ko dijiye.</p>""",
[('Property lead ka pehla reply kitni der me dena chahiye?','Jitna jaldi ho utna behtar, aam taur par 5 minute ke andar. Pehle reply me 2-3 sawal poochhiye: budget, location aur kab tak lena hai.'),
 ('Property lead ko kitni baar follow-up karna chahiye?','1, 3, 7, 15 aur 30 din ka schedule ek achha shuruaati rule hai. Jo lead mana kar de, use dobara message mat bhejiye.'),
 ('Kya follow-up me price negotiation bhi automatic ho sakti hai?','Nahi. Price aur negotiation insaan ka kaam hai. System sirf lead ko aap tak pahunchata hai aur follow-up yaad dilata hai.')]
))

P3.append(mk(
'site-visit-follow-up-property-dealer-templates',
'Site Visit Ke Baad Follow-up: Property Dealer Ke Message Templates',
'Site Visit Ke Baad Follow-up: Property Dealer Ke Templates',
'Site visit ke baad property customer ko kya message bhejein? 8 copy-paste templates: dhanyavaad, rate, parivaar ke liye aur hesitation par jawab.',
'Real Estate',
'real estate lead follow up automation',
'Plot ke saamne dealer aur ek couple, dealer ishara karta hua, phone ke paas hara tick wala follow-up bubble',
'Site visit ke baad pehle 2 ghante me ek chhota thank-you message bhejiye, agle din ek kaam ka sawal ya jaankari, aur 3 din baad ek saaf agla kadam. Bina dabaav ke, har message me ek hi baat. Neeche 8 templates hain jo aap seedha use kar sakte hain.',
"""<p>Site visit property ke business ka sabse bada kadam hai. Customer ne apne paise ka sapna zameen par dekha hai. Ab agle 48 ghante me wo ghar jaakar parivaar se baat karega, kisi aur dealer se bhi shayad milega, aur koi faisla lene ki taraf badhega. Jo dealer us waqt sahi message bhejta hai, wo deal ke kareeb rehta hai. Jo chup rehta hai, wo peeche chhoot jata hai. Neeche wahi sahi message hain, aur unke saath ye bhi ki kab kya nahi bhejna.</p>
<h2>Site visit ke baad ke 4 niyam</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Pehle 2 ghante me ek message.</b> Der na kijiye, par ghabrahat me turant 5 message bhi mat bhejiye.</li>
<li><b>Har message me ek hi baat.</b> Rate, ya sawal, ya agla kadam. Teeno ek saath nahi.</li>
<li><b>Pressure nahi, madad.</b> "Aaj hi book kar lijiye" ki jagah "kuch poochhna ho to batayein".</li>
<li><b>Sach likhiye.</b> Jo documents ya approval ki baat hai, wo wahi likhiye jo aap sach me jaante hain.</li>
</ol>
<h2>8 templates</h2>
<h3>1. Visit ke 2 ghante baad: dhanyavaad</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, aaj [project / plot] dekhne aane ke liye dhanyavaad. Agar kuch poochhna ho, jaise rate, payment plan ya documents, to yahin likh dijiye, main aaram se jawab dunga.</p></div>
<h3>2. Agle din: ek kaam ka sawal</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, kal aapko [plot / flat] kaisa laga? Location aur size ke baare me koi baat khatki ho to bata dijiye, main aapko behtar option bhi dikha sakta hu.</p></div>
<h3>3. Rate aur payment plan bhejna</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, jaisa baat hui thi, [plot / flat] ka rate ₹[amount] hai. Payment plan: [booking amount], [installment ka ek chhota vivaran]. Registry aur baaki kharche [jo sach me lagenge wo likhiye]. Koi sawal ho to poochh lijiye.</p></div>
<h3>4. Parivaar ko dikhane ka offer</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, agar ghar ke baaki log bhi site dekhna chahein to is [din] ko [time] par main khud saath chalunga. Aap bata dijiye, hum time tay kar lete hain.</p></div>
<h3>5. Jab customer chup ho jaye (3-4 din baad)</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, bas ek chhota sa hal poochhna tha. Aap abhi [project] ke baare me soch rahe hain ya koi aur option dekh rahe hain? Jo bhi ho, seedha bata dijiye, main usi hisaab se madad karunga.</p></div>
<h3>6. "Sochke batate hain" par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Bilkul [naam] ji, itna bada faisla soch samajhkar hi lena chahiye. Agar kisi cheez par doubt ho, jaise documents, location ya payment, to mujhe bata dijiye, main saaf jawab dunga. [Din] ko dobara baat karte hain.</p></div>
<h3>7. "Rate zyada hai" par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapki baat samajh aati hai. Is project me jo cheezein shamil hain, jaise [2-3 sach me wali baatein], unko dekhkar rate banaya gaya hai. Aap apna budget bata dijiye, main dekhta hu us me kya option ban sakta hai.</p></div>
<h3>8. Aakhri message (agar customer jawab na de)</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, lagta hai abhi sahi samay nahi hai, koi baat nahi. Jab bhi [plot / flat] ke baare me baat karni ho, yahin message kar dijiye. Aapko shubhkamnayein.</p></div>
<h2>Kab kya mat bhejiye</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Roz message mat bhejiye.</b> Customer pareshan ho jata hai aur number block kar deta hai.</li>
<li><b>"Aaj hi last day hai" jaisa jhootha pressure mat banaiye.</b> Customer ko turant pata chal jata hai.</li>
<li><b>Doosre dealer ki burai mat kijiye.</b> Isse aapka bharosa ghatta hai.</li>
<li><b>Customer ke parivaar ka mazaak mat udaiye.</b> Property ka faisla ghar ka faisla hota hai.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bachche hue sawal aur unke jawab</h2>
<p>Site visit ke baad aksar customer ke 5 sawal hote hain: documents kya hain, registry kaun karwayega, loan milega ya nahi, pass me kya kya hai, aur booking cancel hui to paisa wapas kaise milega. Inke seedhe, saaf aur likhe hue jawab pehle se taiyar rakhiye. Jahan jawab aap par depend nahi karta, jaise loan ya legal salah, wahan kehiye ki ye bank ya vakeel se confirm kar lijiye. Ye aapki izzat badhata hai.</p>
<h2>Ye sab automatic kaise ho sakta hai</h2>
<p>Agar aap roz kai site visit karwate hain, to ye 8 messages haath se bhejna mushkil ho jata hai. Tab system visit hone ke baad apne aap thank-you, agle din ka sawal aur 3 din ka follow-up bhej sakta hai, aur aapko batata hai kaun lead garm hai. Rate, negotiation aur site par baat aap khud karte hain. Poora lead follow-up flow <a href="/blog/real-estate-lead-follow-up-automation-guide/">real estate lead follow-up guide</a> me likha hai. Property ke liye humari <a href="/ai-automation-for-real-estate/">alag page</a> bhi hai.</p>
<h2>Ye 3 cheezein follow-up ko behtar banati hain</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Visit ke dauran notes.</b> Customer ne kya poochha, usne kya pasand kiya. Follow-up me ye baat likhne se message "automatic" nahi, "personal" lagta hai.</li>
<li><b>Photo ya chhota video.</b> Site ki ek photo ya project ka 15 second ka video message se zyada kaam karta hai.</li>
<li><b>Agla kadam saaf.</b> Har message ke ant me ek hi sawal: "Kal 5 baje baat karein?"</li>
</ul>
<h2>Meri raay</h2>
<p>Property me log dealer se khareedte hain, plot se nahi. Isliye follow-up me aapka tone aur sach sabse bada kaam karta hai. Template ek dhaancha hai, uski jagah aapki apni baat zaroor daaliye. Aur ek baar me ek hi message, ek hi sawal: bas itna kaafi hai.</p>""",
[('Site visit ke baad pehla message kab bhejna chahiye?','Visit ke 2 ghante ke andar ek chhota dhanyavaad message bhejiye, jisme aap kisi bhi sawal ke liye uplabdh hone ki baat kahein. Zyada jaldi ya zyada baar bhejna dabaav jaisa lagta hai.'),
 ('Property customer jawab na de to kya karein?','3-4 din baad ek seedha sawal bhejiye, aur phir ek aakhri message. Uske baad customer ko dobara message mat bhejiye, jab tak wo khud na likhe.'),
 ('Kya site visit follow-up automatic ho sakta hai?','Haan, thank-you, agle din ka sawal aur follow-up ka reminder automatic ho sakta hai. Rate, negotiation aur site par baat insaan ko hi karni chahiye.')]
))

P3.append(mk(
'whatsapp-par-customer-ko-reply-kaise-dein-rules',
'WhatsApp Par Customer Ko Reply Kaise Dein: 7 Zaroori Rules',
'WhatsApp Par Customer Ko Reply Kaise Dein: 7 Zaroori Rules',
'WhatsApp par customer ko reply kaise dein: 7 zaroori rules jo order badhate hain, kitni der me reply dein, kya likhein aur kin galtiyon se bachein.',
'WhatsApp Reply',
'whatsapp par customer ko reply kaise dein',
'Dukaan ke counter par stopwatch aur hare tick wala speech bubble, counter par ek phone rakha hua',
'Customer ko WhatsApp par jaldi reply dijiye (5 minute ke andar), pehli line me seedha jawab, naam se baat shuru kijiye, ek hi agla sawal poochhiye, aur raat ke liye ek saaf message rakhiye. Ye 7 rules chhote business ke order aur bharosa dono badhate hain.',
"""<p>WhatsApp par customer ko reply dena ek aam kaam lagta hai, isliye usme sabse zyada galtiyan hoti hain. Koi raat ko jawab nahi deta, koi ek-ek line me jawab deta hai, koi kal ka reply parso deta hai. Aur customer chupchap doosri dukaan chala jata hai, bina kuch kahe. Ye 7 rules chhote business ke liye banaye hain, aur inme koi bhaari cheez nahi hai.</p>
<h2>Rule 1: Pehle 5 minute me reply dijiye</h2>
<p>Customer jab message karta hai to wo us waqt aapke baare me soch raha hota hai. 5 minute baad wo kisi aur dukaan ko message kar chuka hota hai. Aap har waqt phone par nahi baith sakte, isliye ek turant "aapka message mil gaya" wala reply rakhiye, jo aapke khaali hone par jaye. Isse customer ko pata chalta hai ki aap hain, aur wo thoda rukta hai.</p>
<h2>Rule 2: Pehli line me seedha jawab</h2>
<p>Customer ne rate poochha to pehli line me rate. "Namaste, kaise hain aap, bahut bahut dhanyavaad hamari dukaan se judne ke liye" jaisa lamba intro mat likhiye. Customer ne jo poochha hai wahi pehle batao, baad me baaki baat.</p>
<h2>Rule 3: Naam se shuru kijiye</h2>
<p>"Namaste Rakesh ji" aur "Namaste Sir" me bada farak hai. Naam se customer ko lagta hai ki aap use pehchante hain. Agar naam nahi pata to pehle message me poochh lijiye. WhatsApp Business app me contact ka naam save karna aur use message me daalna aasan hai.</p>
<h2>Rule 4: Chhota likhiye</h2>
<p>Mobile par 4-5 line se zyada koi nahi padhta. Agar jawab lamba hai to usse 2 hisson me baantiye, ya list banaiye. Ek lamba paragraph bhejne se customer "baad me padhunga" kehkar bhool jata hai.</p>
<h2>Rule 5: Ek hi agla sawal poochhiye</h2>
<p>"Kya chahiye, kitna chahiye, kab chahiye, kahan bhejna hai, kaise payment karenge?" Paanch sawal ek saath poochhne se customer jawab hi nahi deta. Ek sawal poochhiye: "Kitna quantity chahiye?" Jawab milte hi agla.</p>
<h2>Rule 6: Raat aur chhutti ke liye ek message rakhiye</h2>
<p>Aap hamesha online nahi reh sakte. Ek away message set kijiye: "Abhi hamari dukaan band hai, subah [time] se pehle aapko jawab milega. Tab tak aap [rate / address / timing] bata dijiye." Ye message customer ko rok leta hai. Aur subah ke pehle kaam me raat ke messages ka reply zaroor dijiye.</p>
<h2>Rule 7: Jo vaada kiya wo nibhaiye</h2>
<p>Agar aapne kaha ki "ek ghante me bata dete hain", to ek ghante me bataiye. Customer vaada yaad rakhta hai. Jo bhi baat aap sach me nahi nibha sakte (delivery ka samay, stock, rate), wo likhiye mat. Ek jhoota wada customer ka bharosa tod deta hai, aur WhatsApp par wo baat aapke naam se doosre ko bhi jaati hai.</p>
<h2>In rules ko kaise lagayein: ek hafte ka plan</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Din 1:</b> Away message aur greeting message set kijiye.</li>
<li><b>Din 2:</b> 10 aam sawalon ke jawab quick replies me save kijiye.</li>
<li><b>Din 3:</b> Staff ko batayein ki pehla reply 5 minute me jana chahiye, aur kaun dekhega.</li>
<li><b>Din 4-5:</b> Har enquiry par label lagaiye.</li>
<li><b>Din 6:</b> Apne dost se alag alag samay par sawal bhijwakar test kijiye.</li>
<li><b>Din 7:</b> Gin lijiye kitne reply 5 minute me gaye, kitne late.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Aam galtiyan, aur unka ilaaj</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Galti</th><th>Ilaaj</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>"Seen" kar ke chhod dena</td><td>Kam se kam "dekhta hu, abhi batata hu" bhejiye</td></tr>
<tr><td>Voice note se jawab</td><td>Rate aur address likh kar bhi bhejiye, taaki customer baad me bhi dekh sake</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff ke personal number se reply</td><td>Ek business number, aur staff usi se jawab de</td></tr>
<tr><td>Har customer ko same message</td><td>Naam aur unke sawal ka hawala daaliye</td></tr>
<tr><td>Raat ko 11 baje promotion bhejna</td><td>Sirf kaam ke samay, aur sirf unko jinhone pehle baat ki</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2>Kab ye haath se mushkil ho jata hai</h2>
<p>Jab roz 20-30 se zyada enquiry aane lagti hai, to ye rules haath se nibhana mushkil ho jata hai. Staff thak jata hai, ya raat ke message chhoot jaate hain. Tab system pehla reply, jawab aur follow-up sambhal sakta hai, aur aap sirf mushkil sawal dekhte hain. Is par seedha tareeka <a href="/blog/patna-business-ai-automation-kahan-se-shuru-karein/">kahan se shuru karein</a> me hai. Aur <a href="/#plans">plans</a> me dekhiye ki hum kya sambhalte hain.</p>
<h2>Meri raay</h2>
<p>Reply ki speed aur saaf bhasha, ye dono aapke competition se zyada kaam karte hain, aur dono muft hain. Pehle ye 7 rules apne staff ke saath lagaiye, aur dekhiye kitna fark padta hai. Ready templates ke liye <a href="/blog/whatsapp-customer-reply-ready-templates/">15 ready templates</a> padhiye. Aur agar aapko apni industry ke hisaab se chahiye to <a href="/ai-automation-for-businesses/">industries ke pages</a> dekhiye.</p>""",
[('Customer ko WhatsApp par kitni der me reply dena chahiye?','Aam taur par 5 minute ke andar. Agar aap busy hain to ek chhota "message mil gaya" wala reply bhejiye aur thodi der me poora jawab dijiye.'),
 ('Raat ko aaye message ka reply kaise dein?','Ek away message set kijiye jisme subah ka samay likha ho, aur subah ka pehla kaam raat ke messages ka reply banaiye. WhatsApp Business app me ye aasani se ho jata hai.'),
 ('Kya voice note se reply dena theek hai?','Kabhi kabhi theek hai, par rate, address aur payment jaisi cheezein likh kar bhi bhejiye, taaki customer baad me dobara dekh sake.')]
))

P3.append(mk(
'whatsapp-customer-reply-ready-templates',
'WhatsApp Par Customer Ko Professional Reply: 15 Ready Templates',
'WhatsApp Par Customer Ko Professional Reply: 15 Templates',
'WhatsApp par customer ko professional reply ke 15 ready Hinglish templates: rate, stock, order, payment, delay, shikayat aur review request.',
'WhatsApp Reply',
'whatsapp par customer ko reply kaise dein',
'Khali template cards ka fan jisme sirf placeholder lines hain, bagal me chat bubble wala phone',
'Ye 15 templates rate, stock, order, payment, delay, shikayat aur review request jaise roz ke sawalon ke liye hain. Har template me [bracket] ki jagah apni jaankari daaliye, aur ek line apni bhasha me zaroor jodiye taaki message robot jaisa na lage.',
"""<p>Ye templates copy karke seedha use kar sakte hain. Bas [bracket] wali jagah apni jaankari daaliye. Ek zaroori baat: template ek dhaancha hai, aapka tone nahi. Har template me ek line apni bhasha me zaroor badaliye, warna customer ko pata chal jata hai ki ye sabko ek hi message jata hai. Aur jo likhiye wo wahi ho jo aap sach me nibha sakte hain.</p>
<h2>A. Shuruaat ke templates</h2>
<h3>1. Pehla greeting</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, [dukaan ka naam] me aapka swagat hai. Aap kis cheez ke baare me jaanna chahte hain? Bata dijiye, main turant jaankari bhejta hu.</p></div>
<h3>2. Rate poochhne par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, [product] ka rate [quantity / size] ke liye ₹[amount] hai. [Ek line: kya shamil hai, jaise delivery ya warranty]. Kitna chahiye bata dijiye, main total nikaal deta hu.</p></div>
<h3>3. Stock available hone par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, [product] abhi stock me hai. Aap [aaj / kal] tak le sakte hain, ya delivery chahiye to [shehar / ilaka] me [samay] me pahunch jayega. Photo bhej raha hu.</p></div>
<h3>4. Stock na hone par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, [product] abhi stock me nahi hai, [din] tak aa jayega. Aap chahein to ek milta-julta option [naam] dikha deta hu, ya jab stock aaye to main aapko pehle bata dunga.</p></div>
<h3>5. Address aur timing</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, hamari dukaan [address], [landmark] ke paas hai. Map: [link]. Hum [din] se [din] tak, subah [time] se shaam [time] tak khule rehte hain.</p></div>
<h2>B. Order aur payment ke templates</h2>
<h3>6. Order confirm</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapka order pakka hua: [product], [quantity], ₹[total]. Payment [UPI / account] par kar dijiye, aur screenshot yahin bhej dijiye. Delivery [din] tak hogi.</p></div>
<h3>7. Payment mil gaya</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Dhanyavaad [naam] ji, ₹[amount] ka payment mil gaya. Aapka maal [din] tak [bheja jayega / taiyar hoga]. Tracking ya update isi chat me milega.</p></div>
<h3>8. Dispatch ho gaya</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapka order aaj [time] par nikal gaya hai. [Driver / courier ka naam aur number]. Pahunchne ka anumaanit samay [din / time]. Kuch dikkat ho to yahin likhiye.</p></div>
<h3>9. Payment reminder (naram)</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, ₹[amount] ka payment [date] ko due tha. Agar ho chuka hai to screenshot bhej dijiye. Nahi hua hai to UPI [id] par kar dijiye. Koi dikkat ho to bata dijiye.</p></div>
<h2>C. Mushkil situation ke templates</h2>
<h3>10. Delay hone par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapka order [wajah] ki wajah se [kuch] der se pahunchega, naya samay [din / time]. Is der ke liye hum maafi chahte hain. Agar aap cancel karna chahein to bata dijiye, paisa wapas kar denge.</p></div>
<h3>11. Shikayat aane par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapko hui pareshani ke liye hum maafi chahte hain. Kripya photo ya detail bhej dijiye, hum aaj hi [badalna / paisa wapas / theek karna] ka tareeka bata dete hain.</p></div>
<h3>12. Discount maangne par</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapki baat samajh aati hai. Is rate me hum already [kya kya] de rahe hain. Agar aap [quantity] lete hain to ₹[amount] tak kar sakte hain. Aap bata dijiye.</p></div>
<h2>D. Follow-up aur baad ke templates</h2>
<h3>13. "Sochke batata hu" par follow-up</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, kal aapne [product] ke baare me poochha tha. Koi aur jaankari chahiye to bata dijiye. Aaram se faisla kijiye.</p></div>
<h3>14. Raat ka auto-reply</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste, aapka message mil gaya. Abhi hamari dukaan band hai, subah [time] se pehle aapko jawab mil jayega. Tab tak aap [rate / address / product] bata dijiye.</p></div>
<h3>15. Delivery ke baad review ka request</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapka [product] mil gaya hoga. Kaisa laga? Agar achha laga to Google par ek chhota review de dijiye: [link]. Koi dikkat ho to pehle humein batayein, hum theek kar denge.</p></div>
<h2>In templates ko apna kaise banayein</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Ek line apni bhasha me.</b> "Aapka din shubh ho" ya jo bhi aap hamesha kehte hain.</li>
<li><b>Sach daaliye.</b> Rate, samay, stock sab wahi jo sach me ho.</li>
<li><b>Customer ka naam.</b> Har message me naam zaroor.</li>
<li><b>Chhota rakhiye.</b> Agar template lamba lage to kaat dijiye.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Templates ko save kaise karein</h2>
<p>WhatsApp Business app me Settings me Business tools aur phir Quick replies kholiye. Har template ke liye ek chhota shortcut rakhiye, jaise "/rate", "/stock", "/address". Phir chat me "/" likhte hi shortcut aa jata hai. 15 templates save karne me 15-20 minute lagte hain. Agar aap WhatsApp automation ke liye alag se system chahte hain to <a href="/blog/whatsapp-business-app-vs-api-bihar/">Business app vs API</a> padhiye.</p>
<h2>Jahan ye templates kaam nahi karte</h2>
<p>Templates repetitive sawalon ke liye hain. Jab customer ka sawal alag ho, jaise custom order ya naraazgi, to template ki jagah apni baat likhiye. Aur kabhi bhi kisi ko template bhejne se pehle ek baar padh lijiye ki wo us customer ke sawal ka jawab hai ya nahi. Sabse bura reply wo hai jo customer ke sawal ka jawab nahi deta.</p>
<h2>Meri raay</h2>
<p>15 templates se aapke roz ke 80% sawalon ke jawab ho jaate hain. Baaki 20% me aapki apni baat zaroori hai, aur wahi aapke business ko alag banati hai. Reply ke asli niyam <a href="/blog/whatsapp-par-customer-ko-reply-kaise-dein-rules/">7 zaroori rules</a> me hain. Aur jab enquiry itni badh jaye ki haath se mushkil ho, to <a href="/#plans">plans</a> dekhkar free audit le sakte hain.</p>""",
[('Kya template copy karke bhejna theek hai?','Haan, par [bracket] ki jagah apni jaankari daaliye aur ek line apni bhasha me jodiye. Customer ko pata chal jata hai agar sabko ek hi message jaye.'),
 ('WhatsApp Business app me templates kaise save karein?','Settings me Business tools aur phir Quick replies me jaakar har template ke liye ek shortcut, jaise "/rate", save kijiye. Chat me "/" likhte hi shortcut khulta hai.'),
 ('Shikayat par kaisa reply dena chahiye?','Pehle maafi, phir seedha madad ka tareeka. Photo ya detail maangiye aur batayein ki aap aaj hi kya kar sakte hain. Bahas ya safai se bachiye.')]
))

P3.append(mk(
'customer-follow-up-message-template-hindi',
'Customer Follow Up Message Template Hindi Me (Copy-Paste)',
'Customer Follow Up Message Template Hindi Me (Copy-Paste)',
'Customer follow up message Hindi me kaise likhein: 1, 3, 7 din ke copy-paste templates, alag alag business ke liye aur kya kabhi nahi likhna chahiye.',
'Follow-up',
'customer follow up message template hindi',
'Phone ke paas notepad par likhta hua haath, phone se upar ki taraf badhte teen chat bubbles',
'Customer follow-up message chhota rakhiye, naam se shuru kijiye, ek nayi baat jodiye aur ek hi sawal poochhiye. 1, 3 aur 7 din ke templates neeche hain, aur coaching, clinic, property aur retail ke alag templates bhi. Jo mana kar de use dobara message na bhejiye.',
"""<p>Follow-up ka matlab "yaad dilana" nahi hai, "madad dena" hai. Customer ne poochha, aapne jawab diya, aur phir chup. Ab agar aap kuch nahi likhte to customer bhool jata hai, aur jo bhoola hua order hai wo doosre ko chala jata hai. Neeche Hindi (Hinglish) me templates hain jo seedha copy kiye ja sakte hain, aur saath me wo niyam jo follow-up ko kaam ka banate hain.</p>
<h2>Follow-up ke 5 niyam</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Naam se shuru.</b> "Namaste Rakesh ji."</li>
<li><b>Pichhli baat ka hawala.</b> "Kal aapne [cheez] ke baare me poochha tha." Isse customer ko laga ki ye wahi baat hai.</li>
<li><b>Har message me kuch naya.</b> Wahi sawal baar baar mat poochhiye. Kabhi rate, kabhi photo, kabhi koi sahuliyat.</li>
<li><b>Ek hi sawal.</b> "Kal baat karein?" ya "Photo bhejun?"</li>
<li><b>Mana karne par ruk jaiye.</b> "Abhi nahi chahiye" ka matlab abhi nahi chahiye.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Basic 1-3-7 din templates</h2>
<h3>Din 1: yaad dilana</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, kal aapne [cheez] ke baare me poochha tha. Agar kuch aur jaankari chahiye to bata dijiye, main bhej deta hu.</p></div>
<h3>Din 3: kaam ki cheez</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, [cheez] ke baare me ek chhoti jaankari bhej raha hu: [rate / photo / slot / offer]. Aap chahein to kal [time] par 5 minute baat kar lein?</p></div>
<h3>Din 7: izzat se aakhri message</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, agar abhi sahi samay nahi hai to koi baat nahi. Jab bhi zaroorat ho, yahin message kar dijiye. Aapko shubhkamnayein.</p></div>
<h2>Alag alag business ke templates</h2>
<h3>Coaching</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [parent ka naam] ji, [bachche ka naam] ki demo class ke baad aapko kaisa laga? [Batch] me [kuch] seat bachi hain. Koi sawal ho to bata dijiye, main aaram se jawab dunga.</p></div>
<h3>Clinic</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, doctor ne [din] ko follow-up ke liye bulaya tha. Agar aap aa sakte hain to [time] ka slot khali hai. "1" likhiye to hum book kar dete hain.</p></div>
<h3>Property</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, kal aapne [project] dekha tha. Aapko location aur size kaisa laga? Agar kuch aur option dekhna ho to bata dijiye, main madad kar sakta hu.</p></div>
<h3>Retail / wholesale</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>[Naam] ji, aapne [product] poochha tha. Is hafte [offer / naya stock] aaya hai. Photo bhejun? Bata dijiye, main turant bhej deta hu.</p></div>
<h3>Payment pending</h3>
<div class="tpl"><p>Namaste [naam] ji, ₹[amount] ka payment [date] ko due tha. Agar ho chuka hai to screenshot bhej dijiye. Nahi hua hai to batayein, hum madad kar sakte hain.</p></div>
<h2>Jo follow-up kabhi mat bhejiye</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>"Aap reply kyun nahi kar rahe?"</b> Ye customer ko daant jaisa lagta hai.</li>
<li><b>"Aakhri mauka!" jhootha pressure.</b> Customer turant pehchaan leta hai.</li>
<li><b>Roz ek hi message.</b> Block hone ka sabse tez tareeka.</li>
<li><b>Lamba paragraph.</b> Koi nahi padhta.</li>
<li><b>Bina permission ke bulk forward.</b> Sirf unhe bhejiye jinhone khud aapse baat ki ho.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Kab follow-up band karein</h2>
<p>Teen cases me follow-up band kar dijiye. Pehla, jab customer saaf mana kar de. Doosra, jab aapne 3 follow-up bhej diye aur koi jawab nahi aaya. Teesra, jab customer kehde ki "mujhe message mat bhejna". Is aakhri case me use list se turant hata dijiye. Ye kaam sirf niyam ke liye nahi, aapke number ki safety ke liye bhi zaroori hai, kyunki zyada log report kar dein to WhatsApp number restrict kar sakta hai.</p>
<h2>Follow-up ko system se kaise karwayein</h2>
<p>Agar roz 5-10 enquiry hai to ye follow-up haath se bhi chal jata hai: ek sheet me agle follow-up ki date likhiye aur roz shaam 15 minute messages bhejiye. Jab enquiry badhti hai to bhool jaana aam hota hai. Tab system har enquiry ko 1, 3 aur 7 din par apne aap message bhejta hai, aur sirf unko jinhone jawab nahi diya. Jo jawab de de, wo system se nikal kar aapke paas aa jata hai. Ye kab aur kitna karein, iske liye <a href="/blog/follow-up-kab-karein-bina-pareshan-kiye/">follow-up kab karein</a> padhiye.</p>
<h2>Templates ko apna kaise banayein</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Apni bhasha me ek line.</b> Jaise aap customer se baat karte hain.</li>
<li><b>Ek specific cheez.</b> Customer ne kya poochha tha, wo likhiye.</li>
<li><b>Seedha sawal ya offer.</b> Bina kuch maange follow-up sirf yaad dilana hai.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Meri raay</h2>
<p>Follow-up me jeet usi ki hoti hai jo chhota, saaf aur izzat se likhta hai. Aur sabse zaroori baat ye hai ki aapko pata ho ki aap follow-up kyun kar rahe hain: madad dene ke liye, na ki sirf bechne ke liye. Customer isse turant pehchaan leta hai. Reply ke liye alag se <a href="/blog/whatsapp-customer-reply-ready-templates/">15 ready templates</a> bhi hain. Aur <a href="/ai-automation-for-businesses/">industry ke hisaab se</a> detail dekhne ke liye humare pages dekhiye.</p>""",
[('Customer ko follow-up kitni baar karna chahiye?','Aam taur par 3 baar kaafi hai: 1 din, 3 din aur 7 din baad. Agar tab bhi jawab na aaye to follow-up band kar dijiye.'),
 ('Follow-up message kitna bada hona chahiye?','Mobile par 3-4 line se zyada nahi. Naam, pichhli baat ka hawala, ek nayi cheez aur ek sawal, bas itna kaafi hai.'),
 ('Kya follow-up message automatic bheja ja sakta hai?','Haan, sirf unko jinhone khud aapse baat ki ho. Jo customer jawab de de ya mana kar de, use system se turant nikal dena chahiye.')]
))
